n-more-text\" style=\"font-family: Cabin-semi-bold, Cabin-fallback, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.05rem;\">Learn about our&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.investopedia.com/legal-4768893#editorial-policy\" rel=\"nocaes\" class=\"mntl-author-tooltip__learn-more-link\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(51, 62, 139); font-family: Cabin-semi-bold, Cabin-fallback, sans-serif;\">editorial policies</a>&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"mntl-attribution__item-date\" style=\"display: inline;\">Updated October 11, 2024</div></div><div id=\"mntl-bylines__group_2-0\" class=\"comp mntl-bylines__group mntl-block mntl-bylines__group--finance_reviewer\" style=\"line-height: 2; position: relative; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div id=\"mntl-bylines__item_2-0\" class=\"comp mntl-bylines__item mntl-attribution__item \" style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1;\"><span class=\"mntl-attribution__item-descriptor\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.25rem;\">Reviewed by</span>&nbsp;<div data-tooltip=\"Lea Uradu, J.D., is a Maryland state registered tax preparer, state-certified notary&nbsp;public, certified VITA tax preparer, IRS annual filing season program participant, and tax writer.\" tabindex=\"0\" data-inline-tooltip=\"true\" class=\"mntl-dynamic-tooltip--trigger\" data-tooltip-position-x=\"left\" data-tooltip-position-y=\"bottom\" style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; margin-right: 0.25rem;\"><a href=\"https://www.investopedia.com/lea-d-uradu-4799786\" rel=\"nocaes\" data-trigger-link=\"true\" class=\"mntl-attribution__item-name\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); letter-spacing: 0.05rem; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline; padding-bottom: 1px; font-family: Cabin-semi-bold, Cabin-fallback, sans-serif; line-height: 1; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: dashed;\">LEA D. URADU</a></div></div></div><div id=\"mntl-bylines__group_3-0\" class=\"comp mntl-bylines__group mn