(5, '', NULL, 'Exquisite 2 BHK Furnished Residence', 'This beautiful 2 BHK apartment is perfect for working professionals and families looking for a comfortable stay in Kankarbagh, Patna. Located near Bazar Samiti, it offers excellent connectivity to all major parts of the city.\n\nThe property comes fully furnished with all essential amenities including double beds, sofa set, TV, fully-equipped kitchen, and more. The apartment is well-maintained with ample sunlight and ventilation, designed for a modern lifestyle.\n\nWith 24/7 water and power backup, robust security, and dedicated parking facilities, this apartment ensures a hassle-free and secure living experience for its residents.', 'House', 'For Sale', '404444.00', '₹', 34533.00, 'PROP-20250529-COORPH', NULL, 'Kankarbagh, Patna - Near Bazar Samiti', 'PATNA', 'Bihar', 'India', '805131', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://g.co/kgs/3TVzsry', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1.00, 1.00, 1.00, 2025, 1, 'Fully Furnished', NULL, '[\"Swimming Pool\",\"Gym\",\"Parking\",\"Garden\",\"Security\",\"Lift\",\"Power Backup\",\"WiFi\"]', '[\"Air Conditioning\",\"Heating\",\"TV\",\"Washing Machine\",\"Microwave\",\"Refrigerator\",\"Dishwasher\",\"Balcony\"]', 'After Date', '2025-05-29', NULL, 'properties/main_images/pbMdqdpuYQ4t2jpJfbaE.jpg', 'https://www.techgropse.com/contact', 'properties/floor_plans/2WA8HCKNbL1m6T1wN2Rs.jpg', 'properties/brochures/bsGmJ4QvghlyJ7ECF3lP.pdf', 1, 0, 1, 0, 'Available', 'Nearby Places\r\nBazar Samiti (0.5 km)\r\nParas Hospital (1.2 km)\r\nDAV Public School (1.5 km)\r\nConnectivity\r\nBus Stand (0.8 km)\r\nPatna Junction (4 km)\r\nPatna Airport (7 km)', 'Beautiful 2 BHK apartment ideal for working professionals and families.\nPrime location near Bazar Samiti, Kankarbagh with excellent city connectivity.\nFully furnished: includes beds, sofa, TV, equipped kitchen, and more.\nBright and airy layout with ample sunlight and ventilation.\n24/7 water supply and power backup for uninterrupted living.\nSecure premises with dedicated parking facility and robust safety.', 2, '2025-05-29 01:09:58', '2026-09-09 10:39:14', NULL),
