ave\",\"Refrigerator\",\"Dishwasher\",\"Balcony\"]', 'Immediate', NULL, NULL, 'properties/main_images/A51hReZQ3DhCwUZjsVjD.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'properties/brochures/JTZJo989no8RnkxbfOpm.pdf', 1, 0, 1, 0, 'Available', '<h3 data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"187\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">✅<b>Notes&nbsp;</b><span data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"187\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">What to Include in a Good House Description:</span></h3><p></p><ol data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"596\"><li data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"243\"><p data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"243\"><span data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"208\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Property type</span>&nbsp;(apartment, villa, bungalow, etc.)</p></li><li data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"299\"><p data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"299\"><span data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"255\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Size</span>&nbsp;(square feet, number of bedrooms/bathrooms)</p></li><li data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"351\"><p data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"351\"><span data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"326\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Location highlights</span>&nbsp;(area, nearby landmarks)</p></li><li data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"412\"><p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"412\"><span data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"371\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Key features</span>&nbsp;(modular kitchen, parking, garden, etc.)</p></li><li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"475\"><p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"475\"><span data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"429\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Condition</span>&nbsp;(newly built, fully furnished, ready to move)</p></li><li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"537\"><p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"537\"><span data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"502\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Addition