(25, NULL, NULL, 'RD A M Pinnacle', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">For those looking to buy a residential property, here comes one of the choicest offerings in Patna, at Parsa Bazar. Brought to you by RD Eco Developers, RD A M Pinnacle is among the newest addresses for homebuyers. There are apartments for sale in RD A M Pinnacle Parsa Bazar, Patna. This is a new launch project right now, and is expected to be delivered by Oct, 2025 .</span><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">RD A M Pinnacle Patna is a RERA-registered housing society, which means all projects details are also available on state RERA website for end-users and investors. The RERA registration number of this project is BRERAP00427-9/155/R-1663/2024.</span><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">RD Eco Developers is one of the known real estate brands in Patna.The builder has delivered 10 projects so far. Around 1 project is upcoming. There is 1 project of this builder, which is currently under-construction.</span><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Read on to know more about must-know features, RD A M Pinnacle  Photos,  Floor Plans, Payment Plans, Brochure download procedure  and other exciting facts about the project.</span><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(66, 82, 110); font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(66, 82, 110